          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "description",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Razor helpers, current site context, media, CSS architecture"
        },
        {
          "alias": "title",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Developer Reference \u2014 Helpers \u0026 Extensions"
        },
        {
          "alias": "content",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "contentData": [
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "be80a795-b398-4baa-860a-ee68b7124f11",
                "key": "a2f10006-3001-4000-b006-000000000001",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "alias": "richtext",
                    "culture": "en-US",
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": {
                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003EDeveloper Reference \u2014 Helpers \u0026amp; Extensions\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EuTPro ships a set of Razor/C# helpers used throughout the views. Add \u003Ccode\u003E@using uTPro.Extension;\u003C/code\u003E where needed.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ECurrent Site \u0026amp; Item Context\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EICurrentSiteExtension\u003C/code\u003E (injected as \u003Ccode\u003ECurrentSite\u003C/code\u003E) gives per-request site context:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ECurrentSite.GetItem()\u003C/code\u003E \u2014 key nodes (Root, FolderSettings, PageHome, Current, PageErrors)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ECurrentCulture\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EDefaultCulture\u003C/code\u003E \u2014 active and default cultures\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EGetCultures()\u003C/code\u003E \u2014 all published cultures\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EGetDictionaryValue(key)\u003C/code\u003E \u2014 dictionary translation lookup\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EContent Inheritance\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EContentExtensions\u003C/code\u003E resolves values inherited down the tree (self \u2192 ancestors) with per-request caching. Used for topComponent/bottomComponent cascading.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EMedia \u0026amp; Responsive Images\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EResponsiveImg(...)\u003C/code\u003E renders responsive img (WebP \u002B srcset). Key params: alt, cssClass, sizes, priority (LCP), quality (default 80).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EValueToMediaDesktop/Tablet/Mobile\u003C/code\u003E returns resized media URL strings (2048/1500/800).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EHTML \u0026amp; String Helpers\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Ctable\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth\u003EHelper\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth\u003EPurpose\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EToHtml()\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERenders CMS HTML with best-effort sanitization\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EToInline()\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECollapses newlines to spaces\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ELinkToString()\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafe URL from Umbraco Link\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ECSS Architecture\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EConvention-based CSS in \u003Ccode\u003Ewwwroot/css/{SiteName}/\u003C/code\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Evariables.css\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Design tokens (all colors)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ecritical.css\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Inlined in head\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Elayout.css\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Reset \u002B grid \u002B typography\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Emain.css\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Components \u002B responsive\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComponents/\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Per-component CSS files\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEach component has a matching CSS file registered via \u003Ccode\u003ESetSection\u003C/code\u003E. CSS is only loaded when the component appears on a page.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EBlock Preview Aware Components\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EComponents detect preview mode via \u003Ccode\u003EContext.Request.IsBlockPreviewRequest()\u003C/code\u003E and render CSS only (no JS) in preview.\u003C/p\u003E"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "settingsData": [],
            "expose": [
              {
                "contentKey": "a2f10006-3001-4000-b006-000000000001",
